          "y": 446.7,
          "text": "Question 5 is based on the following scenario. \"Nurathia Farhana browses the UiTM4fly.com website to book for a return flight from KLIA to LAX. While comparing for a better price, two messages popped up in her screen. Figure 1 (a) and (b) illustrate the conveyed messages."
